   the major source of most urban water pollution. However, the current
   literature both at home and aboard rarely involves the analysis of
   pollution source emission characteristics. In this paper, the author
   chooses the consumption level and the disposable income of urban
   residents as the emission characteristic indicators of urban domestic
   pollution sources, building the statistical model of urban domestic
   pollution sources. Based on this, the author divided china into 5
   regions and 25 categories, investigating the reasons of the urban life
