Note = {International Conference on Informational Technology and Environmental
   System Science, Henan Polytechn Univ, Jiaozuo, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY
   15-17, 2008},
Abstract = {Traffic status of urban community is an important part of the whole city
   traffic. In order to evaluate traffic status of community
   scientifically, the concept of traffic saturation is presented. Based on
   the relationship between the using rate of means of transportation for
   community and local traffic flow, a model of traffic capacity is
   developed. The model can describe the dynamic relationship between means
   of transportation and traffic capacity, which provides directions on
   transportation programming for community. Furthermore, some easing
   strategies of traffic capacity are presented. The feasibility of these
   strategies is analyzed by the present model. Simulation experiment by
   this present model predicts dynamic trend of traffic capacity and
   traffic surrounding for community.},
