   Municipal Skiathos; Univ Thessaly, Res Comm; TEE Magnisia Reg Sect;
   Sovel; Themeliodomi SA; Coca Cola HBC},
Abstract = {This paper presents some of the first results of an ongoing project
   investigating the links between architectural forms and their
   environmental performance. Firstly a short analysis of urban space and
   its different components will be presented. Secondly the results of the
   monitoring of two case study locations and their statistical analysis
   will demonstrate the determining parameters affecting the thermal
   environment of an outdoor space. The hypothesis of the project is that a
   variety of conditions can create a thermally diverse environment, which
   will lead to a longer and more fulfilling occupancy.},
