Abstract = {Progress of urbanization is ever accelerating and causing various
   environmental impacts on mankind. Its impacts on river environment are
   no exception. Conspicuous impacts on urban rivers are increasing peak
   flood discharge and total runoff shortening of the runoff period,
   decrease in the low now rate, and the degradation of water quality These
   phenomena are undesirable in view of urban environment. This paper
