   Management},
Abstract = {Shanxi province has developed abundantly in coal industry over the last
   many years and its coal productions spread over most places in China and
   many countries in the world, owing to the exceptional advantages in the
   quantity of coal resources. The highly developed coal industry provided
   abundant energy, but also initiated serious ecological environment
   problems, and influenced and restricted the development quality of
   society, economy and people's living in Shanxi. This paper starts with
   the analysis of the utilization status of coal resources of Shanxi, uses
   the grey model and comprehensive integrated method to predict the coal
   demand, carries on bearing capacity evaluation on the ecological
   environment status and makes environment bearing grading to evaluation
   areas, and finally from the mutual influences and restrictions of
   resources and environment to discusses the problems and countermeasures
   which have important strategic significances in achieving sustainable
   development.},
