Abstract = {The development of economy, traffic and industry have brought worse
   noise-pollution of city residence's environment, the human residing
   acoustical environment quality is getting worse,the development of green
   residential acoustical environment is extremely urgent. Dwelling house's
   sound insulation ability is one of important index of its quality. This
   text aim at the sound insulation problem because of light-weight wall
   being used at large, analyze the principle of sound insulation and
   optimize it,briefly introduce the construction project of dwelling
   house' sound insulation of light-weight wall by experiment contrast,
   expatiate on the technology measure of improving performance of
   light-weight wall.},
