Note = {International Conference on Air Pollution and Environmental Engineering
   (APEE), Hong Kong, HONG KONG, OCT 26-28, 2018},
Abstract = {``Green space{''} is the lung of the city. The rational planning and
   protection of green space is crucial to the construction and development
   of the city. This paper mainly analyzes the problems existing in China's
   current urban green space system planning indicators, discusses the
   principles and index system for establishing the urban green space
   system index system, and proposes a new concept of ecological and
   three-dimensional greening represented by the green quantity rate. It
   analyzes the relationship between urban green space system and urban
   planning, the impact factors of resource reserve and environmental
   pressure in green space system planning and their effects, and controls
   and localizes from urban spatial structure, shape, urban land use,
   environmental quality and population size demand. From the perspective
   of detailed control, a resource-saving and environment-friendly urban
   green space system planning evaluation index system is constructed to
   provide operational decision guidance for urban planning.},
