Abstract = {By the technological developments, the usage of glass in architectural
   area becomes widespread. These developments effects on building and
   space design. So glass plays an effective role in building and space
   design. But generally, its usage for prestige buildings or publical
   buildings as shopping centers, museum,conference centers, airports is
   prefered. In addition this, glass is used in the houses as structural or
   non-structural. The application of glass in the houses, as wide
   surfaces, provides natural lighting, passive heating, aesthetics
   appearance and the most important of this is the visual relation between
   inner and outer spaces. A glasshouse doesn't interrupt the continuity of
   nature. On the contrary, transparency brings the sense of a continuation
   between architecture and nature. Glass protects people from negative
   effects of the nature but doesn't damage relation between people and
   nature. These papers contain searching the effects of glass on house
   building and space design form past to present and the glass usages as a
   design element in houses by different samples.},
